// Ally-touch buff (sheet range: Touch, "a touched willing ally lifts into the air"). No flight
// or gravity-ignore system exists anywhere in this engine (checked common/src/comp/buff.rs and
// common/src/comp/body/mod.rs in full -- no Fly/Levitate BuffKind, no gravity-disable hook).
// Modeled with the existing Hastened buff (movement speed) as the nearest "moves faster than
// normal" primitive; the actual vertical/airborne component and the "falls if the buff ends
// mid-air" rider are both dropped, not silently reinterpreted as anything airborne.
// Same ally-touch delivery shape as water_breathing.ron in this folder (BasicAura, InGroup, a
// short-lived aura entity whose own duration is just long enough to land the touch).
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.3,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: Hastened,
            strength: 0.15,
            duration: Some(60.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(1.0),
    range: 3.0,
    energy_cost: 70.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Arcane), cooldown: Some(35.0)),
)
